{
    "title": "Canopy - Parental Control App",
    "description": "Canopy empowers you to parent in the digital world. Our cutting edge parental control features keep your family safe online. The Canopy system inspects images, videos and websites before they appear on your child\u2019s device and blocks porn and unsafe content in real-time before your child is exposed. Canopy isn\u2019t just for kids \u2013 it's designed to provide the entire family with a healthy and positive online experience. \r\n\r\nDownload Canopy to start your 7-day free trial today!\r\n\r\nTake control of your family\u2019s online safety with Canopy: \r\n\r\nReal-Time Smart Filter & Porn Blocker\r\nHarness the power of artificial intelligence to seamlessly remove pornographic content (and even partial nudity!) from websites and apps in milliseconds, ensuring a healthy, positive digital experience. Even better, our AI doesn\u2019t block safe content \u2013 get the good without the bad!\r\n\r\nSexting Alerts\r\nMonitors the camera on the protected device, preventing your child from sharing inappropriate photos, and notifies you immediately if a risky photo is detected.\r\n\r\nScreen Time Management\r\nSet DownTime and screentime limits for the protected device to limit internet use at specific times. \r\n\r\nRemoval Alerts\r\nGet notified quickly if your child tries to remove or disable Canopy.\r\n\r\nWebsite Management\r\nCreate a customized list of blocked or allowed websites to personalize your family's online experience.\r\n\r\nLocation Awareness\r\nKeep up with your child no matter where life takes them using a detailed real-time GPS map. \r\n\r\nApp Management\r\nCurate your child\u2019s app collection. Block distracting and inappropriate apps and games.\r\n\r\nEasy Monitoring\r\nReceive convenient notifications when Canopy is doing its job of protecting your child online. We\u2019ll notify you when we block inappropriate content or prevent inappropriate behavior from happening.  You can adjust Canopy\u2019s settings from your personal device using the Canopy for Parents app or Canopy web dashboard.\r\n\r\nFree 7-day trial with every subscription! Subscribe monthly, or on an annual basis for best value. \r\n\r\n*Important note: this app is the control app for the Canopy Shield app. You should download Canopy to your personal device. After you create your account, Canopy will lead you through the process for installing Canopy Shield on your child\u2019s Android phone or Chromebook. For Canopy to work, you must install Canopy Shield on your child\u2019s device.\r\nIf you are installing Canopy for yourself, you can download both apps on the same device. \r\n\r\nJoin over 100,000 families worldwide who trust Canopy to provide a safer online experience. Our app not only protects your kids - it also encourages responsible habits, transparency, and trust while creating opportunities for important conversations. Canopy empowers you to parent in the digital world, just like you do in the real one.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, our friendly customer support team is available every day from 12 p.m. to 8 p.m CT via phone or our help center site. \r\n(888) 820-1918 / https://help.canopy.us/\r\n\r\nDon't let the risks of the internet hold you back - download Canopy today and experience the digital world safely and positively.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use - https://canopy.us/end-user-license-agreement\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy - https://canopy.us/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Canopy empowers you to parent in the digital world. Our cutting edge parental control features keep your family safe online. The Canopy system inspects images, videos and websites before they appear on your child\u2019s device and blocks porn and unsafe content in real-time before your child is exposed. Canopy isn\u2019t just for kids \u2013 it&#39;s designed to provide the entire family with a healthy and positive online experience. <br><br>Download Canopy to start your 7-day free trial today!<br><br>Take control of your family\u2019s online safety with Canopy: <br><br>Real-Time Smart Filter &amp; Porn Blocker<br>Harness the power of artificial intelligence to seamlessly remove pornographic content (and even partial nudity!) from websites and apps in milliseconds, ensuring a healthy, positive digital experience. Even better, our AI doesn\u2019t block safe content \u2013 get the good without the bad!<br><br>Sexting Alerts<br>Monitors the camera on the protected device, preventing your child from sharing inappropriate photos, and notifies you immediately if a risky photo is detected.<br><br>Screen Time Management<br>Set DownTime and screentime limits for the protected device to limit internet use at specific times. <br><br>Removal Alerts<br>Get notified quickly if your child tries to remove or disable Canopy.<br><br>Website Management<br>Create a customized list of blocked or allowed websites to personalize your family&#39;s online experience.<br><br>Location Awareness<br>Keep up with your child no matter where life takes them using a detailed real-time GPS map. <br><br>App Management<br>Curate your child\u2019s app collection. Block distracting and inappropriate apps and games.<br><br>Easy Monitoring<br>Receive convenient notifications when Canopy is doing its job of protecting your child online. We\u2019ll notify you when we block inappropriate content or prevent inappropriate behavior from happening.  You can adjust Canopy\u2019s settings from your personal device using the Canopy for Parents app or Canopy web dashboard.<br><br>Free 7-day trial with every subscription! Subscribe monthly, or on an annual basis for best value. <br><br>*Important note: this app is the control app for the Canopy Shield app. You should download Canopy to your personal device. After you create your account, Canopy will lead you through the process for installing Canopy Shield on your child\u2019s Android phone or Chromebook. For Canopy to work, you must install Canopy Shield on your child\u2019s device.<br>If you are installing Canopy for yourself, you can download both apps on the same device. <br><br>Join over 100,000 families worldwide who trust Canopy to provide a safer online experience. Our app not only protects your kids - it also encourages responsible habits, transparency, and trust while creating opportunities for important conversations. Canopy empowers you to parent in the digital world, just like you do in the real one.<br><br>If you have any questions, our friendly customer support team is available every day from 12 p.m. to 8 p.m CT via phone or our help center site. <br>(888) 820-1918 / https://help.canopy.us/<br><br>Don&#39;t let the risks of the internet hold you back - download Canopy today and experience the digital world safely and positively.<br><br>Terms of Use - https://canopy.us/end-user-license-agreement<br><br>Privacy Policy - https://canopy.us/privacy",
